WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:10.470
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Here are ten top tips to make your car journey safe.

2
00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:14.408
Tip one

3
00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:16.742
Plan your journey.

4
00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:22.203
Look at a map and plan where to stop on the way.

5
00:00:27.811 --> 00:00:29.010
Tip two

6
00:00:30.258 --> 00:00:32.106
Check your car.

7
00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:37.697
Is it ready for a long journey?

8
00:00:38.508 --> 00:00:42.754
Do it yourself or take it to a garage.

9
00:00:59.447 --> 00:01:00.906
Tip three

10
00:01:01.651 --> 00:01:05.492
Listen to traffic information on the radio,

11
00:01:07.242 --> 00:01:12.234
or check on the internet, before you start your journey.

12
00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:26.075
Tip four

13
00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:30.240
Take a map with you in the car,

14
00:01:31.342 --> 00:01:34.421
or have a map app on your phone

15
00:01:38.408 --> 00:01:43.319
– satnav (or GPS) isn’t always right.

16
00:01:57.176 --> 00:01:58.456
Tip five

17
00:01:59.753 --> 00:02:02.038
Take bottles of water.

18
00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:09.363
People are often thirsty on long car journeys.

19
00:02:20.919 --> 00:02:22.053
Tip six

20
00:02:28.633 --> 00:02:35.927
If you have children in the car, take books, games, and tablets with you.

21
00:02:36.964 --> 00:02:41.097
Then the children can watch videos or read.

22
00:02:42.636 --> 00:02:47.968
When children are quiet, the driver is less distracted.

23
00:02:51.258 --> 00:02:52.636
Tip seven

24
00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:02.279
Check that all the passengers in the car have their seat belt on.

25
00:03:13.689 --> 00:03:15.018
Tip eight

26
00:03:16.201 --> 00:03:18.956
Check that you have petrol.

27
00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:26.249
Don’t wait until your petrol tank is nearly empty

28
00:03:26.298 --> 00:03:29.717
before you look for a petrol station.

29
00:03:40.932 --> 00:03:42.375
Tip nine

30
00:03:43.396 --> 00:03:46.394
After driving for two hours,

31
00:03:46.653 --> 00:03:50.008
stop for fifteen minutes.

32
00:03:52.002 --> 00:03:55.681
Have a snack, and get some fresh air.

33
00:04:01.045 --> 00:04:04.594
If you’re very tired, have a coffee

34
00:04:05.259 --> 00:04:07.447
or a drink with caffeine.

35
00:04:08.598 --> 00:04:12.552
Finally, tip ten.

36
00:04:13.816 --> 00:04:17.090
This is very, very important.

37
00:04:20.655 --> 00:04:23.135
Don’t use your phone.

38
00:04:24.642 --> 00:04:32.081
Phoning and texting are very dangerous because you don’t concentrate on the road.

39
00:04:42.162 --> 00:04:43.961
Have a safe journey!